«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  TriLeftAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "TriLeftAll: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → Xminv Xmaxv Xv « Xminv 0 + Xmaxv 0 + Xv 0 + → Xmin Xmax X « 'IFTE(X≤Xmin;0;IFTE(X≥Xmax;1;1-((Xmax-X)^2)/((Xmax-Xmin)^2)))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<Xmin;0;IFTE(X>Xmax;0;2*(Xmax-X)/((Xmax-Xmin)^2)))' →Num "PDF" →Tag '1-Kc' →Num "CDFc" →Tag '(2*Xmin+Xmax)/3' →Num "μ" →Tag '(Xmax-Xmin)/√(18)' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE Xminv Xmaxv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
